<title>PHILIPPINES: Union Bank Jan-Mar net up 16 percent.</title>
<headline>Union Bank Jan-Mar net up 16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31.</p>
<p>	    (in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income			300.2 vs 258.6</p>
<p>Note: Full name Union Bank of the Philippines. Company said total resources grew 30 percent to 42.3 billion pesos year-on-year while loans grew 38 percent to 26.2 billion pesos.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
